    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11729" root="خوف" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَافَةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of 1, (S, Msb, K, &amp;c.,) originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْوَفَةٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Also <i>A cause of fear:</i>
a word of the same category as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْبَنَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْخَلَةٌ</span>
&amp;c.: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَاوِفُ</span>. Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوَّلُ كُتُبِهِ المَخَاوِفُ</span>
[<i>The first of his letters,</i> or <i>epistles, consisted of
the causes of fear</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَاوِفُ</span> also
signifies <i>Places of fear.</i> (KL.)

